{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"幂等伴随"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"幂等伴随"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathcal C\\ \r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\overset{F}{\\rightarrow}\\\\\r\n\\bot\\\\\r\n\\underset{G}{\\leftarrow}\r\n\\end{aligned}\\ \r\n\\mathcal D\r\n$$\n的单位为 $\\eta\\colon 1\\to GF$, 余单位为 $\\varepsilon\\colon FG\\to 1$. 若以下等价条件成立, 则称之为<strong>幂等伴随</strong> (idempotent adjunction):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\varepsilon F\\colon FGF \\to F$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>$G\\varepsilon\\colon GFG\\to G$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>$G\\varepsilon F\\colon GFGF \\to GF$ 为等价, 即"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随给出单子","text":"伴随给出的单子"}},{"Plain":" $GF$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"幂等单子","text":"幂等单子"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$F\\eta\\colon F\\to FGF$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>$\\eta G\\colon G\\to GFG$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>$F\\eta G\\colon FG \\to FGFG$ 为等价, 即伴随给出的余单子 $FG$ 为幂等余单子;</li>\n<li>伴随 $F\\dashv G$ 有如下分解, 其中 $\\mathcal E$ 为 $GF,FG$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"不动点","text":"不动点"}},{"Plain":", $F_2$, $G_1$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"全忠实函子","text":"全忠实函子"}},{"Plain":":</li>\n</ul>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathcal C\\ \r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\overset{F_1}{\\rightarrow}\\\\\r\n\\bot\\\\\r\n\\underset{G_1}{\\hookleftarrow}\r\n\\end{aligned}\\ \r\n\\mathcal E\\ \r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\overset{F_2}{\\hookrightarrow}\\\\\r\n\\bot\\\\\r\n\\underset{G_2}{\\leftarrow}\r\n\\end{aligned}\\ \r\n\\mathcal D\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>拓扑空间与位象</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"清醒空间","text":"清醒空间"}},{"Plain":" (sober space) 的范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑空间"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"位象","text":"位象"}},{"Plain":"之间的伴随的不动点.</p>\n"}]}}